WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.170
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:05.440 --> 00:12.039
[Episode 4]

3
00:18.200 --> 00:19.433
Bullseye.

4
00:19.433 --> 00:22.152
He's... angry.

5
00:25.313 --> 00:28.113
I must have crossed the line somewhere.

6
00:33.473 --> 00:35.232
Even a crush should be polite.

7
00:35.232 --> 00:38.033
Not disturbing him is my bottom line.

8
00:38.033 --> 00:41.233
Staying silent is my principle.

9
00:41.233 --> 00:43.625
This is Zhao Sheng Ge's warning.

10
00:45.673 --> 00:46.712
He has no reason,

11
00:46.712 --> 00:49.989
nor should he have to bear any influence I bring.

12
00:55.993 --> 00:59.203
Looks like I missed out on a lot of fun.

13
01:01.553 --> 01:03.593
Sorry for coming late.

14
01:05.152 --> 01:06.673
Mr. Zhao.

15
01:06.673 --> 01:07.913
Long time no see.

16
01:07.913 --> 01:09.553
Ms. Xu.

17
01:10.392 --> 01:11.392
Don't just stand around me.

18
01:11.392 --> 01:13.472
Keep playing. I'm not the target.

19
01:13.472 --> 01:14.552
The sea is rough.

20
01:14.552 --> 01:16.513
You come from a family with a long history of learning.

21
01:16.513 --> 01:19.192
I wonder how your marksmanship is.

22
01:32.793 --> 01:34.953
I thought I hid it well.

23
01:34.953 --> 01:36.752
Where exactly did it go wrong?

24
01:36.752 --> 01:38.953
What does he know?

25
01:42.112 --> 01:43.489
Are you okay?

26
01:44.433 --> 01:46.315
Impressive, Ms. Xu.

27
01:47.272 --> 01:48.433
Why don't...

28
01:48.433 --> 01:50.593
Mr. Zhao and Ms. Xu have a match?

29
01:50.593 --> 01:52.793
Then, Mr. Zhao, shall we have a round?

30
01:52.793 --> 01:54.293
Sure.

31
02:05.892 --> 02:07.613
Bullseye.

32
02:08.352 --> 02:10.233
Bullseye.

33
02:10.233 --> 02:11.233
Bullseye.

34
02:11.233 --> 02:13.352
- Are you okay? - I'm fine.

35
02:13.352 --> 02:14.992
What's wrong with you two?

36
02:15.793 --> 02:17.232
I worked up a sweat shooting.

37
02:17.232 --> 02:19.833
I'm going to the restroom... to change.

38
02:19.833 --> 02:21.553
You guys enjoy yourselves.

39
02:21.553 --> 02:23.072
I'm leaving.

40
02:30.632 --> 02:32.232
Eighth ring.

41
03:22.113 --> 03:23.588
Bullseye.

42
03:28.113 --> 03:29.833
Mr. Zhao.

43
03:29.833 --> 03:31.393
The eighth ring...

44
03:31.393 --> 03:33.632
You went easy on me.

45
03:36.672 --> 03:38.192
Mr. Zhao.

46
03:38.192 --> 03:39.404
Mr. Zhao.

47
03:40.313 --> 03:42.553
Ms. Xu, please, go ahead.

48
03:42.553 --> 03:44.433
You didn't invite me here today

49
03:44.433 --> 03:47.192
just to test my marksmanship, did you?

50
03:47.192 --> 03:48.593
We wouldn't dare, Ms. Xu.

51
03:48.593 --> 03:49.752
Your marksmanship is just like

52
03:49.752 --> 03:51.433
Bai Sheng's moves over the years.

53
03:51.433 --> 03:53.313
Precise and steady.

54
03:53.313 --> 03:54.553
We invited you here

55
03:54.553 --> 03:58.792
because we hope our partnership can also be precise and steady.

56
03:58.792 --> 04:00.352
Fine.

57
04:00.352 --> 04:02.553
Then let's talk business.

58
04:02.553 --> 04:04.912
Bai Sheng always has a clear target.

59
04:04.912 --> 04:06.833
Since you've invited us to the table,

60
04:06.833 --> 04:08.713
you should show some sincerity.

61
04:08.713 --> 04:13.833
Ms. Xu, I believe we've shown plenty of sincerity.

62
04:13.833 --> 04:15.072
All right.

63
04:15.072 --> 04:16.393
The land at Lychee Bay...

64
04:16.393 --> 04:18.033
Everyone is fighting for it.

65
04:18.033 --> 04:20.352
But in the last two years, no one has dared to touch it.

66
04:20.352 --> 04:22.912
Between the recent trouble-making and the petitions...

67
04:22.912 --> 04:25.673
The He family is at a critical stage.

68
04:25.673 --> 04:27.072
They don't dare take it on, so...

69
04:27.072 --> 04:31.193
This part of the project will be handled entirely by Minglong.

70
04:31.193 --> 04:33.050
That is our sincerity.

71
04:33.953 --> 04:35.232
Good.

72
04:35.232 --> 04:37.792
Since you've shown such sincerity,

73
04:37.792 --> 04:40.472
Bai Sheng is officially in.

74
04:40.472 --> 04:42.872
Ms. Xu, it's a pleasure doing business with you.

75
04:42.872 --> 04:44.792
A pleasure doing business with you.

76
05:09.552 --> 05:11.052
Wait.

77
05:14.552 --> 05:16.273
Thank you.

78
05:21.393 --> 05:22.593
Here, this is for you, too.

79
05:22.593 --> 05:24.352
Thank you.

80
05:24.352 --> 05:25.713
You're welcome.

81
05:25.713 --> 05:27.792
Security doesn't come this way.

82
05:30.513 --> 05:33.833
If you crush it flat, you can fit more in.

83
05:35.432 --> 05:36.932
Watch.

84
05:41.273 --> 05:42.872
Let's do it together.

85
05:45.593 --> 05:47.472
Where do you usually collect things?

86
05:47.472 --> 05:49.792
D-Dongyang Street.

87
05:49.792 --> 05:51.593
It's hard to find things there.

88
05:51.593 --> 05:53.312
Yes.

89
05:53.312 --> 05:54.513
I'll tell you about a place.

90
05:54.513 --> 05:57.232
There's a hole behind Wong Tai Sin Park.

91
05:57.992 --> 06:00.033
No security guards patrol there.

92
06:00.033 --> 06:02.073
You're small enough to squeeze through.

93
06:02.073 --> 06:04.153
How do you know?

94
06:06.912 --> 06:08.232
Go there once yourself,

95
06:08.232 --> 06:10.833
and you'll know if I'm telling the truth.

96
06:10.833 --> 06:12.953
But you still have to be careful.

97
06:16.753 --> 06:17.792
Are you tired?

98
06:17.792 --> 06:18.992
No.

99
06:18.992 --> 06:20.593
Do you go to school?

100
06:22.193 --> 06:24.232
Do you want to try it?

101
06:24.232 --> 06:26.792
Think of it as an extra treasure hunt.

102
06:26.792 --> 06:28.472
A treasure hunt?

103
06:28.472 --> 06:30.912
What can I find?

104
06:33.792 --> 06:34.953
Well...

105
06:34.953 --> 06:36.753
I don't know either.

106
06:36.753 --> 06:40.153
Everyone finds different treasures.

107
06:40.833 --> 06:42.792
This is something...

108
06:42.792 --> 06:44.640
you have to discover for yourself.

109
06:46.033 --> 06:48.273
This is enough to take to the recycling center to be weighed.

110
06:48.273 --> 06:49.833
Don't hoard too much at once.

111
06:49.833 --> 06:51.393
And don't wait until dark to go.

112
06:51.393 --> 06:52.872
It's best to go during the day.

113
06:52.872 --> 06:54.312
Try to stay where there are people.

114
06:54.312 --> 06:55.953
Bye-bye.

115
07:02.872 --> 07:04.912
Was that a little beggar?

116
07:04.912 --> 07:06.672
I've already ordered extra patrols,

117
07:06.672 --> 07:08.112
but it's hard to keep them all out.

118
07:08.112 --> 07:10.432
Mr. Qin, is it over in there?

119
07:10.432 --> 07:12.232
Why are you out here?

120
07:12.232 --> 07:15.273
I came out to change and have a smoke.

121
07:15.992 --> 07:18.872
If it's not over yet, why don't we leave?

122
07:23.393 --> 07:25.472
A polite smile.

123
07:25.472 --> 07:27.513
It seems you can still tell.

124
07:27.513 --> 07:29.112
Zhao Sheng Ge.

125
07:29.112 --> 07:30.472
Are you done changing?

126
07:30.472 --> 07:32.872
Nian has been waiting for a long time.

127
07:32.872 --> 07:34.372
Let's go.

128
07:42.992 --> 07:44.552
Hey.

129
07:46.953 --> 07:48.513
It's me.

130
07:53.672 --> 07:56.033
Do you have a phone at home?

131
07:56.872 --> 07:58.833
Or how can I find you?

132
07:58.833 --> 08:01.033
Behind Wong Tai Sin Park,

133
08:01.033 --> 08:02.633
halfway up Shatin Pass Road,

134
08:02.633 --> 08:04.352
there's an abandoned old sentry box.

135
08:04.352 --> 08:05.833
I cleaned it up myself.

136
08:05.833 --> 08:08.633
No one knows about it.

137
08:08.633 --> 08:10.193
I'll come find you again next time.

138
08:10.193 --> 08:12.352
You have to learn to take care of yourself.

139
08:19.432 --> 08:23.153
Sometimes, the gap between us is unavoidable.

140
08:40.432 --> 08:42.033
I left something behind.

141
08:42.033 --> 08:43.033
I'll go back and get it.

142
08:43.033 --> 08:45.072
Okay. Then hurry up.

143
08:50.113 --> 08:53.432
Mr. Qin, the chef made many kinds of steamed rice cakes today.

144
08:53.432 --> 08:57.712
- What flavors are there? - Red bean, coconut, and osmanthus.

145
08:57.712 --> 08:59.753
I haven't had steamed rice cakes since I was a kid.

146
08:59.753 --> 09:01.113
Wan. Come over here.

147
09:01.113 --> 09:02.672
We're just waiting for you.

148
09:10.312 --> 09:11.993
The food is being served.

149
09:11.993 --> 09:14.312
Thank you. You can serve the food now.

150
09:17.753 --> 09:19.592
Enjoy your meal, everyone.

151
09:34.353 --> 09:37.153
Zhi Xuan, this soup tastes quite good.

152
09:41.512 --> 09:42.553
Everyone, try some.

153
09:42.553 --> 09:45.512
How are the steamed rice cakes made by our pastry chef?

154
09:54.312 --> 09:56.832
Xuan, these steamed rice cakes...

155
09:56.832 --> 09:58.592
Why do they taste different from the usual ones?

156
09:58.592 --> 09:59.993
They're fine.

157
09:59.993 --> 10:02.592
I used to eat them often in school.

158
10:35.072 --> 10:38.192
Mr. Qin, please have my piece.

159
10:38.192 --> 10:39.993
I haven't touched it.

160
10:40.672 --> 10:41.993
You're not eating?

161
10:41.993 --> 10:43.393
I'm full.

162
10:43.393 --> 10:45.033
Please help me finish it,

163
10:45.033 --> 10:46.153
so it doesn't go to waste.

164
10:46.153 --> 10:48.233
Then I won't stand on ceremony.

165
11:03.072 --> 11:05.233
Sheng Ge, what do you think?

166
11:05.912 --> 11:07.832
It's just so-so.

167
11:13.513 --> 11:14.633
What is this?

168
11:14.633 --> 11:16.312
Osmanthus seeds infused with honey.

169
11:16.312 --> 11:18.387
It's meant to be eaten with the steamed rice cakes.

170
11:19.233 --> 11:20.832
How much should I add?

171
11:20.832 --> 11:22.753
Can you help me with it?

172
11:33.113 --> 11:35.072
It actually suits my taste quite well.

173
11:35.072 --> 11:36.633
I want some, too.

174
11:49.952 --> 11:52.633
The atmosphere is a bit strange.

175
11:54.033 --> 11:56.113
Mr. Zhuo, besides the steamed rice cakes,

176
11:56.113 --> 11:58.033
what other new things do you have?

177
11:58.033 --> 12:00.792
Tea tobacco is trending in Hai City now.

178
12:00.792 --> 12:03.312
You add special tea leaves to the tobacco.

179
12:03.312 --> 12:05.072
- And then? - Roll it yourself.

180
12:05.072 --> 12:06.393
Want to give it a try?

181
12:06.393 --> 12:07.832
Sure. Let's try it.

182
12:07.832 --> 12:09.353
We're going retro today.

183
12:09.353 --> 12:11.353
Mr. Tan, do you know how to roll them?

184
12:11.353 --> 12:12.353
No.

185
12:12.353 --> 12:14.072
I can learn.

186
12:24.993 --> 12:28.552
It's been so long, and I've been troubling you.

187
12:38.353 --> 12:40.153
My world...

188
12:41.153 --> 12:43.615
It's like a nightmare I can't wake from.

189
12:46.072 --> 12:48.473
Tumbling through hallucinations.

190
12:49.432 --> 12:53.113
Is there any moment, any scene,

191
12:53.113 --> 12:55.033
even if it only lasts a second,

192
12:55.033 --> 12:58.095
that makes you feel a bit more real?

193
13:01.393 --> 13:02.952
Yes.

194
13:04.233 --> 13:07.552
The moment I met him at Xiaolan Mountain.

195
13:07.552 --> 13:09.873
Since there's someone so real to you,

196
13:09.873 --> 13:11.990
you could pursue him.

197
13:13.192 --> 13:14.661
Pursue him?

198
13:18.033 --> 13:20.393
He is so wonderful.

199
13:20.393 --> 13:22.192
I shouldn't disturb him.

200
13:22.192 --> 13:23.993
"Shouldn't disturb him."

201
13:23.993 --> 13:27.121
You've been saying that for many years.

202
13:32.633 --> 13:34.993
I shouldn't let my loneliness,

203
13:34.993 --> 13:38.873
darkness, and failures... disturb him.

204
13:39.513 --> 13:42.993
I used to think that as long as I didn't startle him,

205
13:42.993 --> 13:46.103
I could keep living in this dream all by myself.

206
13:50.393 --> 13:52.393
But look at it now.

207
13:53.192 --> 13:56.273
My solitary dream is about to end.

208
14:33.072 --> 14:36.657
So, he has so many beautiful lighters.

209
14:53.432 --> 14:54.592
Hey, darling.

210
14:54.592 --> 14:55.873
What have you been up to lately?

211
14:55.873 --> 14:58.473
Come shopping with me.

212
14:58.473 --> 15:01.072
I've been very busy lately.

213
15:01.072 --> 15:03.552
Shop for clothes with me.

214
15:03.552 --> 15:04.952
Oh, listen.

215
15:04.952 --> 15:07.113
I've met a few girls lately.

216
15:07.113 --> 15:09.312
They're very elegant and well-mannered.

217
15:09.312 --> 15:10.993
I'm really busy.

218
15:10.993 --> 15:13.113
You always say you're busy when I ask you to come with me.

219
15:13.113 --> 15:14.832
All right then.

220
15:16.592 --> 15:19.113
Okay. Be good, bye.

221
15:24.072 --> 15:25.153
Xuan.

222
15:25.153 --> 15:26.952
Why didn't you invite Wan?

223
15:26.952 --> 15:28.513
Of course I did.

224
15:28.513 --> 15:30.192
I don't know what he's busy with lately.

225
15:30.192 --> 15:31.312
I've asked him out several times.

226
15:31.312 --> 15:33.279
He's never had the time.

227
15:34.192 --> 15:36.033
I feel like I haven't seen him in ages.

228
15:36.033 --> 15:38.153
Don't you think so, Sheng Ge?

229
15:38.153 --> 15:39.672
I haven't noticed.

230
15:39.672 --> 15:41.672
I'll give him a call.

231
15:45.552 --> 15:47.033
Hello, Wan.

232
15:47.033 --> 15:49.832
Long time no see.

233
15:49.832 --> 15:52.672
By the way, we're all at Xuan's place.

234
15:52.672 --> 15:54.153
Are you coming over?

235
15:54.153 --> 15:55.912
Mr. Tan, I'm really sorry.

236
15:55.912 --> 15:57.473
I still have a lot of work to finish.

237
15:57.473 --> 16:00.113
Let's meet up some other time. You guys have fun.

238
16:01.753 --> 16:03.253
All right.

239
16:08.753 --> 16:10.153
Come on. Cheers.

240
16:10.153 --> 16:11.653
Hello.

241
16:12.712 --> 16:15.633
Sir, there's trouble at the Lychee Bay area again.

242
16:15.633 --> 16:18.952
They agreed to the terms, but suddenly changed their minds.

243
16:18.952 --> 16:21.083
Okay. I see.

244
16:43.312 --> 16:45.072
Chen Wan.

245
16:49.153 --> 16:50.233
Hello.

246
16:50.233 --> 16:51.993
I'm Xu En Yi.

247
16:51.993 --> 16:54.393
I've met a few girls lately.

248
16:54.393 --> 16:56.033
They're very elegant and well-mannered.

249
16:56.033 --> 16:58.552
The daughter of the oil tycoon, Xu?

250
16:59.832 --> 17:01.332
Please, have a seat.

251
17:04.273 --> 17:07.552
Looks like we were both tricked into coming here.

252
17:13.273 --> 17:14.352
What's wrong, Ms. Xu?

253
17:14.352 --> 17:16.392
Is my face dirty?

254
17:17.273 --> 17:18.392
Chen Wan.

255
17:18.392 --> 17:20.753
You look better than your photos.

256
17:21.953 --> 17:24.094
You're too kind, Ms. Xu.

257
17:25.352 --> 17:28.673
Construction on the Lychee Bay port is set to begin soon.

258
17:28.673 --> 17:29.753
It is worth noting that,

259
17:29.753 --> 17:32.993
besides the Tan and Shen families, who are close to the Zhaos,

260
17:32.993 --> 17:35.913
the Xu family has also secured a valuable investment stake.

261
17:35.913 --> 17:40.673
Does this mean the Zhaos and Xus are preparing for a marriage alliance?

262
17:53.033 --> 17:54.112
Ms. Xu.

263
17:54.112 --> 17:57.112
Our collaboration this time will surely shake up Hai City.

264
17:57.112 --> 18:02.072
But I heard there's a new situation at Lychee Bay.

265
18:02.713 --> 18:05.993
The news only broke less than an hour ago.

266
18:05.993 --> 18:08.233
You really are well-informed.

267
18:08.233 --> 18:09.552
But it's no matter, Ms. Xu.

268
18:09.552 --> 18:10.552
In a corner of the Lychee Bay coast,

269
18:10.552 --> 18:12.273
generations have lived in those shanties.

270
18:12.273 --> 18:14.392
They caused trouble and got more compensation a few days ago,

271
18:14.392 --> 18:15.953
but they still refuse to move.

272
18:15.953 --> 18:17.392
Now they're stirring up trouble again.

273
18:17.392 --> 18:20.112
We suspect Luo Gan Sheng is behind this.

274
18:20.112 --> 18:21.473
The investigation results just came in,

275
18:21.473 --> 18:22.953
but they haven't been verified yet.

276
18:22.953 --> 18:24.993
I haven't had the chance to update you yet.

277
18:26.792 --> 18:29.632
Luo Gan Sheng.

278
18:29.632 --> 18:31.392
An old acquaintance.

279
18:31.392 --> 18:33.792
He has a grudge against my grandfather.

280
18:33.792 --> 18:35.872
My grandfather's plan to invest in Lychee Bay

281
18:35.872 --> 18:37.913
is already known in certain circles.

282
18:37.913 --> 18:41.792
He's clearly trying to make things difficult for Bai Sheng.

283
18:43.352 --> 18:46.592
Find someone to talk to him.

284
18:46.592 --> 18:48.473
Don't be too flashy about it.

285
18:50.072 --> 18:52.673
He stole a route from my grandfather years ago.

286
18:52.673 --> 18:54.392
His methods are dirty.

287
18:54.392 --> 18:57.513
If necessary, I can ask my grandfather to step in.

288
18:57.513 --> 18:58.913
Just let me handle it.

289
18:58.913 --> 19:01.233
There's no need to trouble Mr. He.

290
19:02.312 --> 19:04.072
I'll await your good news.

291
19:06.713 --> 19:08.552
That land in Lychee Bay...

292
19:08.552 --> 19:10.673
with the Zhao family in your way,

293
19:10.673 --> 19:12.513
it'll be tough.

294
19:14.112 --> 19:16.993
The feeling is mutual.

295
19:21.112 --> 19:23.273
Zhao Sheng Ge...

296
19:23.273 --> 19:25.312
is not easy to deal with.

297
19:25.312 --> 19:28.112
He's all smiles and polite on the surface,

298
19:28.112 --> 19:29.673
but behind your back,

299
19:29.673 --> 19:32.433
every strike draws blood.

300
19:34.072 --> 19:35.993
So...

301
19:35.993 --> 19:39.312
So, we need to find another way.

302
19:41.433 --> 19:44.033
Xiaolan Mountain.

303
19:44.033 --> 19:48.072
If we can restart that project,

304
19:48.072 --> 19:51.728
we won't have to care about Zhao Sheng Ge's attitude.

305
19:55.072 --> 19:56.953
Gan Sheng.

306
19:56.953 --> 19:59.953
We're thinking the same thing.

307
20:01.273 --> 20:03.193
What a pity.

308
20:03.193 --> 20:05.913
The Xiaolan Mountain deal

309
20:05.913 --> 20:08.552
has been abandoned for too long.

310
20:09.552 --> 20:13.072
It needs someone with money and connections.

311
20:14.352 --> 20:16.673
You have the connections.

312
20:17.392 --> 20:20.273
And you... have the money.

313
20:23.673 --> 20:24.753
Is it not decided yet?

314
20:24.753 --> 20:28.713
Do you know our biggest competitor is Luo Gan Sheng?

315
20:30.632 --> 20:32.132
I know.

316
20:38.433 --> 20:39.953
Wan.

317
20:39.953 --> 20:43.713
At this price, we won't have much profit left.

318
20:47.953 --> 20:50.832
Patent licensing, technology dividends,

319
20:50.832 --> 20:53.792
and the next few years' revenue combined,

320
20:53.792 --> 20:55.433
it'll be fine.

321
20:57.753 --> 21:00.473
Do you know how much Luo Gan Sheng bid?

322
21:01.473 --> 21:03.273
Luo Gan Sheng is a total bastard.

323
21:03.273 --> 21:05.832
Everyone in Hai City hates him.

324
21:05.832 --> 21:08.112
But no one can get rid of him.

325
21:08.112 --> 21:10.033
Now that we're in a life-or-death crisis,

326
21:10.033 --> 21:12.632
he's still trying to sabotage us.

327
21:12.632 --> 21:15.112
Why hasn't anyone dealt with him?

328
21:18.513 --> 21:20.513
I want to try.

329
21:28.152 --> 21:30.592
Your hearing is scheduled in three days.

330
21:30.592 --> 21:32.673
It will be confidential, as you requested.

331
21:32.673 --> 21:34.713
All staff will sign an NDA.

332
21:34.713 --> 21:36.312
Anything else to add?

333
21:36.312 --> 21:38.273
Nothing to add.

334
21:38.273 --> 21:41.713
I really wish there were more brave citizens like you.

335
21:41.713 --> 21:43.993
Stay in the safe house for these three days.

336
21:43.993 --> 21:45.552
We'll have a staff member assigned

337
21:45.552 --> 21:47.033
to ensure your safety.

338
21:47.033 --> 21:48.352
Okay, I understand.

339
21:48.352 --> 21:50.552
Remember, do not wander off.

340
21:50.552 --> 21:52.872
Otherwise, we can't guarantee your safety.

341
21:52.872 --> 21:55.086
I understand, Officer.

342
22:04.312 --> 22:07.233
Don't mind the mental hospital sign here.

343
22:07.233 --> 22:09.552
They're actually all good kids.

344
22:09.552 --> 22:12.153
You've all been so kind to sponsor us.

345
22:12.153 --> 22:14.953
I'm truly grateful.

346
22:14.953 --> 22:17.913
It's only right to let the children

347
22:17.913 --> 22:20.152
meet their kind sponsors.

348
22:28.080 --> 22:29.640
[Han Jin: Jin, I'm caught up with something lately.]

349
22:29.640 --> 22:31.200
[Will be out of office.]

350
22:31.200 --> 22:34.480
[Zhuo Zhi Xuan: I'm busy lately and can't be contacted.]

351
22:34.480 --> 22:37.800
[Don't worry.]

352
22:39.792 --> 22:40.793
Chen Wan.

353
22:40.793 --> 22:42.913
What are you up to now?

354
22:42.913 --> 22:45.673
I need to go off the grid for a bit.

355
22:48.632 --> 22:51.913
I'm warning you, if you're hiding anything, you're dead.

356
23:01.152 --> 23:02.233
Hey, darling.

357
23:02.233 --> 23:03.312
What's wrong?

358
23:03.312 --> 23:05.632
Mom, I met a master who said

359
23:05.632 --> 23:07.353
I'll face a bloody disaster soon.

360
23:07.353 --> 23:08.353
But as long as my female relatives

361
23:08.353 --> 23:10.033
stay home and pray for me for three days,

362
23:10.033 --> 23:11.352
I'll be able to escape it.

363
23:11.352 --> 23:14.112
How can that be? Is he for real?

364
23:14.112 --> 23:15.433
Better safe than sorry.

365
23:15.433 --> 23:18.433
I'll bring you a Cartier necklace when I'm back.

366
23:19.233 --> 23:21.513
All right then. I'll pray for you at home.

367
23:21.513 --> 23:23.033
You be careful.

368
23:23.033 --> 23:25.632
Okay. Remember, don't go out.

369
23:25.632 --> 23:27.872
Okay, bye.

370
23:32.273 --> 23:34.312
I'm at the safe house now.

371
23:34.993 --> 23:36.493
Good.

372
23:37.233 --> 23:39.072
Zhao Sheng Ge, say that again.

373
23:39.072 --> 23:40.112
Mr. Chen is going to the hearing

374
23:40.112 --> 23:42.152
to testify against Luo Gan Sheng in three days.

375
23:42.152 --> 23:45.233
It's about Luo Gan Sheng's smuggling.

376
23:45.233 --> 23:46.592
Why so sudden?

377
23:46.592 --> 23:49.352
I heard it's related to the bidding.

378
23:51.592 --> 23:53.552
Chen Wan looks like a gentleman,

379
23:53.552 --> 23:56.152
but he's quite a risk-taker.

380
23:56.152 --> 23:58.273
This is exactly what we needed.

381
23:58.273 --> 24:02.152
It seems like Chen Wan and Lychee Bay are quite fated.

382
24:02.152 --> 24:04.112
Say something, Nian.

383
24:04.112 --> 24:07.273
Chen Wan might not even make it to the hearing.

384
24:07.273 --> 24:09.953
You mean... he's in danger?

385
24:10.792 --> 24:13.152
If I've received the news,

386
24:13.152 --> 24:15.548
then Luo Gan Sheng likely has, too.

387
24:16.832 --> 24:19.592
We have to help him, for many reasons.

388
24:19.592 --> 24:20.872
Ming is right.

389
24:20.872 --> 24:24.433
For many reasons, we have to step in.

390
24:27.632 --> 24:29.592
Wait a little longer.

391
24:39.600 --> 24:42.673
[Chen Wan]

392
24:42.673 --> 24:45.673
The subscriber you have dialed is not available.

393
24:45.673 --> 24:47.352
Please try again later.

394
24:47.352 --> 24:49.872
What is he up to?

395
25:29.312 --> 25:30.913
Simon.

396
25:30.913 --> 25:32.673
If there's news from Luo Gan Sheng,

397
25:32.673 --> 25:34.433
let me know immediately.

398
25:34.433 --> 25:35.568
Yes, sir.

399
25:49.632 --> 25:50.792
I just received word.

400
25:50.792 --> 25:51.872
A man named Chen Wan

401
25:51.872 --> 25:55.072
is going to testify against you at the customs hearing.

402
25:59.033 --> 26:01.632
Chen Wan?
